    "TAR_raiding_category": "Border Situation",
    "TAR_raiding_category_desc": "Geographically, our country is surrounded on all sides by Russians who do not share our views and do not recognize our independence. The only thing stopping them from attacking us now is the constant German bombing, their own weakness, or fear of being attacked by other contenders. Under these conditions, we have no choice but to strengthen our own defense capabilities and conduct more regular raids.\n\nIn essence, the main threat to us in the short term is posed by the KONR, located in Samara. These ROA are no better than the Bolsheviks, equally advocating the destruction of ethnic states and their absorption into their structures. To counter them, we have reached an agreement with the Gorky Tank Brigade, which will supply us with weapons to deter the common southern threat. However, we can take more... radical steps against the KONR by staging terrorist attacks and raids.",
